    },
    {
     "type": "ABSTRACT",
     "group": "MAIN",
     "text": "Everyone from AI executives and researchers to doomsayers",
     "in_flow": 1,
     "in_side": null,
     "ok": true
    },
    {
     "type": "ABSTRACT",
     "group": "MAIN",
     "text": "they often don't seem to agree on its exact definition",
     "in_flow": 1,
     "in_side": null,
     "ok": true
    },
    {
     "type": "SECTION_HEADING",
     "group": "MAIN",
     "text": "1. Introduction",
     "in_flow": 1,
     "in_side": null,
     "ok": true
    },
    {
     "type": "BODY",
     "group": "MAIN",
     "text": "The AI community has become increasingly fractured over where the field is headed",
     "in_flow": 1,
     "in_side": null,
     "ok": true
    },
    {
     "type": "BODY",
     "group": "MAIN",
     "text": "Central to all of these views is the concept of Artificial General Intelligence",
     "in_flow": 1,
     "in_side": null,
     "ok": true
    },
    {
     "type": "BODY",
     "group": "MAIN",
     "text": "widely public debates, much of the disagreement stems less from evidence",
     "in_flow": 1,
     "in_side": null,
     "ok": true
    },
    {
     "type": "LIST",
     "group": "MAIN",
     "text": "Human intelligence is not general in any meaningful way",
     "in_flow": 1,
     "in_side": null,
     "ok": true
    },
    {
     "type": "SECTION_HEADING",
     "group": "MAIN",
     "text": "2. Human Intelligence is Specialized",
     "in_flow": 1,
     "in_side": null,
     "ok": true
    },
    {
     "type": "BODY",
     "group": "MAIN",
     "text": "Evolution has honed humanity over time to be highly",
     "in_flow": 1,
     "in_side": null,
     "ok": true
    },
    {
     "type": "SECTION_HEADING",
     "group": "MAIN",
     "text": "Alternative Views",
     "in_flow": 1,
     "in_side": null,
     "ok": true
    },
    {
     "type": "SECTION_HEADING",
     "group": "MAIN",
     "text": "3.1. A Survey of Definitions",
     "in_flow": 1,
     "in_side": null,
     "ok": true
    },
    {
     "type": "CAPTION",
     "group": "MAIN",
     "text": "Figure 2. Illustration of the task space overlap between the human",
     "in_flow": 1,
     "in_side": null,
     "ok": true
    },
    {
     "type": "BODY",
     "group": "MAIN",
     "text": "Given the utility of specialization, we propose Superhuman Adaptable Intelligence",
     "in_flow": 1,
     "in_side": null,
     "ok": true
    },
    {
     "type": "SECTION_HEADING",
     "group": "MAIN",
     "text": "6. Discussion",
     "in_flow": 1,
     "in_side": null,
     "ok": true
    },
    {
     "type": "QUOTE",
     "group": "MAIN",
     "text": "The AI that folds our proteins should not be the AI that folds our laundry!",
     "in_flow": 1,
     "in_side": null,
     "ok": true
    },
    {
     "type": "REFERENCES",
     "group": "SUPPLEMENTARY",
